{"id":"wb-3-5","name":"太平天国侍王府","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"太平天国侍王府","text":"太平天国侍王府位于中国浙江省金华市婺城区鼓楼里70号，历史上曾用作唐宋婺州州署、明代巡按御史行台、清代金华府试院和太平天国侍王李世贤王府，建筑由东院、西院、练兵场和后花园（内有水池、假山等）等组成，为现存太平天国建筑中保存最完整、规模最宏大、壁画等艺术品最多的一处。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E5%B9%B3%E5%A4%A9%E5%9B%BD%E4%BE%8D%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%9C","revisionId":94954588,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94954588","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核名称、所在地与对应遗址；原名录行政地址及参考点位不作为唯一判断依据","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/522b0dffe3c59c319765238d.jpg","title":"King_of_Shi_Mansion_of_the_Taiping_Heavenly_Kingdom_04_2019-11.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:King_of_Shi_Mansion_of_the_Taiping_Heavenly_Kingdom_04_2019-11.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/King_of_Shi_Mansion_of_the_Taiping_Heavenly_Kingdom_04_2019-11.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​太平天国侍王府，头门南面。","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图"}}